## 📌 Quick Reference & Formatting Guide

Use these markdown snippets when adding your inspiration items:

- **Adding a Web Link:**
  `[Site Name](https://example.com) — Short note on what to take from this site.`
- **Adding an Online Image:**
  `![Inspo Description](https://images.unsplash.com/... or direct image URL)`
- **Adding a Local Image:**
  Drop your image files into `public/inspo/` and embed them like:
  `![Inspo Description](/inspo/screenshot-name.png)`
- **Side-by-Side Image Comparison:**
  ```html
  <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
    <img src="/inspo/example1.png" width="48%" alt="Option A" />
    <img src="/inspo/example2.png" width="48%" alt="Option B" />
  </div>
  ```

